      "title": "Trump claims US will end military aid to Israel by end of this year",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/03/donald-trump-usa-end-military-aid-to-israel-end-year-midterms",
      "description": "<p>US president makes surprise election day announcement, saying country does not ‘need’ $4bn annual payment</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a> has said that the US will end military aid to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/israel\">Israel</a> at the end of this year in a surprise election day announcement that appeared to be targeted at voters sceptical of US support for Israel and the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/israel-hamas-war\">war in Gaza</a>.</p><p>In a phone interview with Fox News as voting began on Tuesday morning, the US president said the US would cut nearly $4bn (£2.96bn) in military aid to Israel because “they don’t need it”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/03/donald-trump-usa-end-military-aid-to-israel-end-year-midterms\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-03T17:17:11"
    },
